# Build-output rules for this directory. They repeat the root .gitignore ON PURPOSE.
# The delivery step that hands this repository between sessions replaces the ROOT
# .gitignore with a generic template and commits whatever is on disk; nested .gitignore
# files survive it (B-0 root cause: docs/design/B0_REPOSITORY_STATE_ROOT_CAUSE_2026_10_12.md).
# Do not delete this file because the root .gitignore "already has" these rules.
# Gate: python3 scripts/check_repo_hygiene.py (probes every Python/npm/Foundry directory).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
